    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68126" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῐτό-ομαι</span></b> , 
			Med.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ply the woof</i>
			in weaving, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.285
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Nicarch.
			</span></i>): metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθόγγον μιτώσασθαι</span>
			<i>let one's</i> voice <i>sound like a string</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				7.195
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>); also, of Fate, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μοῖρα οὕτω ἐμιτώσατο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(9).1240.15
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Aedepsus</span>).</div>
